  "notes": "Literature reconstruction. The paper's database states d = 8. Readings here, accelerated RIS: X side 200000 trials 8; X side 2000000 trials 8; Z side 200000 trials 8; Z side 2000000 trials 8. Witnessed upper bound. Of the 47 codes in the paper's Table I screened against the board at their stated check weights, this is the only one the four-axis rule leaves undominated; [[72,20,6]] (weight 16) is dominated by the board's [[66,20,7]], the [[37,1,7]] and [[63,2,7]] triples are already on the board, and the rest are dominated by lighter or larger entries."
